 the accelerator companies with the purchase of the Santana royalty…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/osisko-gold-royalties-ltd-or-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"OR 2019 Q4","e":"or","d":"2020-02-20","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Sean Roosen","x":"…probably the most significant royalty that has been done in the last 24 months in the royalty and streaming space. And as they march forward, they were supposed to have nine months to a year of loading onto their pad, they have been able to work through this winter and achieve better than that,…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/osisko-gold-royalties-ltd-or-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"OR 2019 Q4","e":"or","d":"2020-02-20","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sean Roosen","x":"…to the lowest cost operating mill in Canada, 55,000 ton a day, same large mill that operates on tariff electricity from Hydro-Quebec makes us an exceptional discovery and evolution, and our friends at [Indecipherable] have a significant amount of expertise and low-grade underground development…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/osisko-gold-royalties-ltd-or-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"OR 2019 Q4","e":"or","d":"2020-02-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Elif Levesque","x":"…but Osisko's stream interest is secured and we're working closely with Lydian to be a part of the restructuring solution and to reflect RHS going forward. Also in February 2020, recently numerous operators of the Eleonore mine announced updated mineral resource and resources decreasing in total…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/osisko-gold-royalties-ltd-or-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"OR 2020 Q1","e":"or","d":"2020-05-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Sean Roosen","x":"We have the most amount of gold revenues of all the royalty and streaming companies in the space.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/14/osisko-gold-royalties-ltd-or-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"OR 2020 Q1","e":"or","d":"2020-05-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Sean Roosen","x":"…the accelerator model, which is somewhat unique to us and we are currently operating at the highest cash margins of anybody in the royalty and streaming space at 91% with an exceptionally low geopolitical risk with over 68% of our assets being in Canada, 86% here in North America by geography.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/14/osisko-gold-royalties-ltd-or-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"OR 2020 Q2","e":"or","d":"2020-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Sean Roosen","x":"And that sort of, I think, distinguishes the portfolio from a lot of others since it is a dominantly royalty portfolio as opposed to a streaming portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/osisko-gold-royalties-ltd-or-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"OR 2020 Q2","e":"or","d":"2020-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Sean Roosen","x":"And they're so much better than anybody else's royalty and streaming deal in the space that it's hard to argue that we wouldn't want to continue on with that business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/osisko-gold-royalties-ltd-or-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"OR 2020 Q2","e":"or","d":"2020-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"George Topping","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/osisko-gold-royalties-ltd-or-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"OR 2020 Q2","e":"or","d":"2020-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Frederic Ruel","x":"As you know, after withdrawing our guidance for the year in March due to the uncertainties related to the pandemic, we have now issued a new guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/osisko-gold-royalties-ltd-or-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"O